        "TileImage": "$($repository ee277dd3-825d-46bb-ac6f-95f25c94676f).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, your targets are Rico Delgado the head of the Delgado Cartel, his wife Catalina Delgado, his brother Hector, his drug chimist Jorge Franco, and his coworker who take care of the logistics Andrea Martinez.\rThis cartel lived for too long now, he is responsible for numerous death in Chile and Colombia, 47 you have to shut him down with a freedom of approach. I will leave you to prepare.\rGood luck 47",
